IMPORTANT — Third-party standards are NOT covered by this license.

This repository distributes only the distilled layer: the standards index,
tiering model, clause-level digests, method index, and CLI tooling.

Full texts of standards are NOT included, and their copyrights belong to
their respective organizations:
  · JEDEC / JESD  — JEDEC Solid State Technology Association
  · IPC / J-STD   — IPC (Association Connecting Electronics Industries)
  · JS-001        — EOS/ESD Association, Inc. + JEDEC
  · AQG 324       — ECPE e.V. (CC BY-ND)
  · IEC           — International Electrotechnical Commission
  · MIL-STD-883   — U.S. Government work (public domain)
  · GJB 548       — 中国国家军用标准

To use the indices and digests in this repository you must obtain the
corresponding standards from their official sources.
